{
 "brief": "Riyad al-Ashqar, head of the Palestine Prisoners' Studies Center, said Israeli minister Itamar Ben Gvir's entry into prisoner Hasan Salameh's cell and threats to kill him constitute campaign theatrics, according to Shehab Wire. Al-Ashqar cautioned that despite the electoral motive, the threats cannot be dismissed as harmless.\n\nBen Gvir's actions represent a serious danger to Salameh's life given the minister's official position in Israel's government, al-Ashqar warned. He called the incident both a political stunt and a genuine threat that must be taken seriously.",
